1f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"罗唐战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0978"},{"title":"唐灭百济之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0971"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/五、唐上（卷五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"辽东城，即隋炀帝所攻平壤城也。百济，今朝鲜国南境全罗道是...","context_before":"...四十二、县百，又置安东都护于平壤城，以统高丽、百济之地。","source_end_index":425,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"43dbbe86-da2f-5c93-9ada-11c3438676a8","source_start_index":405,"source_text":"既而高丽余众复叛，其旧城多为新罗所窃据。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/五、唐上（卷五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/十、女真（卷三十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...本夫余别种，其王亦姓扶余氏，滨海之阳，直京师六千里而嬴，","source_end_index":460,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"58da7be4-66ce-5d28-b312-2eb118d17bdf","source_start_index":433,"source_text":"仪凤以后，百济之地，附于新罗，其支属共保海滨，仍曰百济"},{"context_after":"开元以后，其地多为勃海所并。○休忍国，在新罗之东，亦二韩...","context_before":"...元初，新罗据百济故地，又招纳高丽叛众，遣兵讨之，复请降。","source_end_index":319,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"5cc6c1f2-e042-5fb1-b2a0-765a33c70f9b","source_start_index":291,"source_text":"仪凤以后，复西据高丽故城，唐不能讨。自是仅羁属于唐而已。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/十、女真（卷三十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政","外交"],"content":"2初，劉仁軌引兵自熊津還，扶餘隆畏新羅之逼，不敢留，尋亦還朝。二月，丁巳，以工部尚書高藏爲遼東州都督，封朝鮮王，遣歸遼東，安輯高麗餘衆；高麗先在諸州者，皆遣與藏俱歸。又以司農卿扶餘隆爲熊津都督，封帶方王，亦遣歸安輯百濟餘衆，仍移安東都護府於新城以統之。時百濟荒殘，命隆寓居高麗之境。藏至遼東，謀叛，潛與靺鞨通；召還，徙邛州而死，散徙其人於河南、隴右諸州，貧者留安東城傍。高麗舊城沒於新羅，餘衆散入靺鞨及突厥，隆亦竟不敢還故地，高氏、扶餘氏遂亡。","content_fanyi":"起初，刘仁轨率兵从熊津返回，扶余隆畏惧新罗的逼迫，不敢留驻，不久也回到朝廷。二月二十四日丁巳，任命工部尚书高藏为辽东州都督，封为朝鲜王，送他返回辽东，安抚高丽余众；原先安置在各州的高丽人，都遣送与高藏一同回去。又任命司农卿扶余隆为熊津都督，封为带方王，也送他回去安抚百济余众，并将安东都护府迁到新城，以统辖辽东州和熊津。当时百济荒凉残破，命扶余隆借居高丽境内。高藏到了辽东，阴谋反叛，暗中与靺鞨勾结；朝廷召他返回，把他迁到邛州而死，他的部属被分散迁徙到河南、陇右各州，贫穷的留在安东城旁。高丽旧城被新罗吞并，余众散入靺鞨和突厥，扶余隆也终究不敢返回故地，高氏、扶余氏于是灭亡。","content_jianti_auto":"2初，刘仁轨引兵自熊津还，扶余隆畏新罗之逼，不敢留，寻亦还朝。二月，丁巳，以工部尚书高藏为辽东州都督，封朝鲜王，遣归辽东，安辑高丽余众；高丽先在诸州者，皆遣与藏俱归。又以司农卿扶余隆为熊津都督，封带方王，亦遣归安辑百济余众，仍移安东都护府于新城以统之。时百济荒残，命隆寓居高丽之境。藏至辽东，谋叛，潜与靺鞨通；召还，徙邛州而死，散徙其人于河南、陇右诸州，贫者留安东城傍。高丽旧城没于新罗，余众散入靺鞨及突厥，隆亦竟不敢还故地，高氏、扶余氏遂亡。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19908,"number":2,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"b9d0403f-db0e-11ef-97d5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4b2-db0e-11ef-a71e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"郝，呼各翻。處，昌呂翻。唐制，東宮左、右庶子，各二員。","note_content_jianti_auto":"郝，呼各翻。处，昌吕翻。唐制，东宫左、右庶子，各二员。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4b1-db0e-11ef-a164-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"左庶子","official_note":"左庶子是唐代东宫官职，负责辅导太子，属于太子府属官。在《资治通鉴》此段中，郝處俊和高智周被任命为左庶子，反映了高宗时期对太子教育的重视。","official_rank":"正四品上","source_snippet":"以郝處俊、高智周並爲左庶子","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"b557e0a3-c00a-4afc-99c2-7ebb5d71f961"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"右庶子","official_note":"右庶子是唐代东宫官职，与左庶子类似，负责辅佐太子，属于太子府属官。在此段中，李義琰被任命为右庶子，进一步体现了对太子事务的安排。","official_rank":"正四品上","source_snippet":"李義琰爲右庶子","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"d0f06bc4-9353-420a-b310-431d0ff2fef2"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":607,"link_death_year":681,"link_td_description":"郝处俊，安州安陆（今湖北省安陆市）人，唐朝官员。","link_td_id":"Q10010605","link_td_number_id":1091381,"people_name":"郝處俊","people_name_jianti_auto":"郝处俊","people_xingming":"郝处俊","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4b3-db0e-11ef-a162-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":602,"link_death_year":683,"link_td_description":"高智周，常州晋陵人，唐朝官员，唐高宗年间为宰相。","link_td_id":"Q10017761","link_td_number_id":5247741,"people_name":"高智周","people_name_jianti_auto":"高智周","people_xingming":"高智周","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4b4-db0e-11ef-923b-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":688,"link_td_description":"李义琰，魏州昌乐县（今河南省濮阳市南乐县）人，祖籍陇西郡狄道县（今甘肃省定西市临洮县），唐高宗宰相，身长八尺，魁梧俊秀，博学有识。爵封酒泉县公。","link_td_id":"Q10002840","link_td_number_id":1567433,"people_name":"李義琰","people_name_jianti_auto":"李义琰","people_xingming":"李义琰","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4b5-db0e-11ef-957e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"b9d2a4b0-db0e-11ef-88e4-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"yǎn","source_anchor_text":"庶子李義琰為右庶子","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":24,"text":"琰","tongjian_id":"35df9f1f-7f59-59a7-973e-0e4121476f70"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"3三月，癸亥朔，以郝處俊、高智周並爲左庶子，李義琰爲右庶子。","content_fanyi":"三月初一癸亥，朝廷任命郝处俊、高智周同为左庶子，李义琰为右庶子。","content_jianti_auto":"3三月，癸亥朔，以郝处俊、高智周并为左庶子，李义琰为右庶子。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19909,"number":3,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4b0-db0e-11ef-88e4-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"張公謹","people_name_jianti_auto":"张公谨","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4b8-db0e-11ef-b904-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"太宗","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4b9-db0e-11ef-9713-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"張公謹，太宗朝功臣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"张公谨，太宗朝功臣。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4b7-db0e-11ef-9e2c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"左庶子","official_note":"左庶子是唐代东宫官职，负责辅导太子，属于文教类官职。在《资治通鉴》此段中，张太安原任左庶子，后被任命为同中书门下三品，反映了唐代官员的升迁路径。","official_rank":"正四品上","source_snippet":"左庶子張大安","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"40684b29-eac5-41c5-a453-41b3c43a0cf0"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"同中書門下三品","official_note":"同中书门下三品是唐代宰相的加衔，表示官员具有与中书省、门下省长官同等的三品地位，参与中枢决策。在此段中，张太安被任命为此职，标志其进入宰相行列。","official_rank":"宰相级","source_snippet":"同中書門下三品","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"7e800658-7585-49f2-9476-1657d2938b13"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"大安","people_name_jianti_auto":"大安","people_xingming":"张大安","start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4ba-db0e-11ef-9770-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":594,"link_death_year":632,"link_td_description":"张公谨，字弘慎，魏州繁水（在今河南省濮阳市南乐县）人，唐朝初期政治人物和军事将领，曾在唐与东突厥的战争中起到关键性的作用，另外，在玄武门之变中辅佐了日后唐太宗李世民登基。","link_td_id":"Q10005086","link_td_number_id":567551,"people_name":"公謹","people_name_jianti_auto":"公谨","people_xingming":"张公瑾","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4bb-db0e-11ef-9d67-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"夏，四月，左庶子張大安同中書門下三品。大安，公謹之子也。","content_fanyi":"夏季，四月，朝廷任命左庶子张大安担任同中书门下三品。张大安，是张公谨之子。","content_jianti_auto":"夏，四月，左庶子张大安同中书门下三品。大安，公谨之子也。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19910,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4b6-db0e-11ef-9fac-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"寧陵縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"宁陵县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4be-db0e-11ef-bfc5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4bf-db0e-11ef-ad85-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陳留郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"陈留郡","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4c0-db0e-11ef-bd0d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"曹魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"曹魏","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4c1-db0e-11ef-9ff0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"元魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"元魏","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4c2-db0e-11ef-82b0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"譙郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"谯郡","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4c3-db0e-11ef-9549-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"后齐","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4c4-db0e-11ef-93c4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4c5-db0e-11ef-a576-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"宋州","place_name_jianti_auto":"宋州","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4c6-db0e-11ef-9bd9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"寧陵縣，漢屬陳留郡，曹魏至元魏，屬譙郡，後齊廢，隋開皇六年復置，屬宋州。賑，津忍翻。上，時掌翻。疏，所據翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"宁陵县，汉属陈留郡，曹魏至元魏，属谯郡，后齐废，隋开皇六年复置，属宋州。赈，津忍翻。上，时掌翻。疏，所据翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4bd-db0e-11ef-90dc-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"御史中丞","official_note":"御史中丞是唐代御史台的副长官，负责监察百官，此处被派遣执行赈灾任务，体现了其监察职能在地方事务中的应用。","official_rank":"正四品下","source_snippet":"遣御史中丞崔謐等分道存問賑給","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"e36a0eb4-4267-4553-9dd7-063071ff3a5c"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"监察","official_name":"侍御史","official_note":"侍御史是唐代御史台的官员，负责弹劾和监察，此处刘思立上疏批评赈灾方式，展示了其监察和谏议的职责。","official_rank":"从六品下","source_snippet":"侍御史寧陵劉思立上疏","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"76163b67-5ce9-42a6-a9a6-8bf6dc8058aa"},{"confidence":0.8,"official_category":"中枢近臣","official_name":"敕使","official_note":"敕使是皇帝派遣的使者，负责传达诏令或执行特殊任务，此处指被派去抚巡赈灾的官员，体现了中央对地方事务的直接干预。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"敕使撫巡","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"e481ee8d-9340-4285-b422-430f4514a74e"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"崔謐","people_name_jianti_auto":"崔谧","people_xingming":"崔谧","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4c9-db0e-11ef-933c-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"劉思立","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘思立","people_xingming":"刘思立","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4ca-db0e-11ef-bb29-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"謐","people_name_jianti_auto":"谧","people_xingming":"崔谧","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4cd-db0e-11ef-b2df-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"b9d2a4bc-db0e-11ef-a52c-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"biàn","source_anchor_text":"巡人皆竦抃忘其家業","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":58,"text":"抃","tongjian_id":"6a238ea6-8518-53c2-8f82-35d3abf71a8d"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","resolved_place_entity_id":59,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4cb-db0e-11ef-bba5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"寧陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"宁陵","place_note":"河南省宁陵县","resolved_place_entity_id":1623,"start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4cc-db0e-11ef-bd39-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"4詔以河南、北旱，遣御史中丞崔謐等分道存問賑給。侍御史寧陵劉思立上疏：以爲：「今麥秀蠶老，農事方殷，敕使撫巡，人皆竦抃，忘其家業，冀此天恩，聚集參迎，妨廢不少。旣緣賑給，須立簿書，本欲安存，更成煩擾。望且委州縣賑給，待秋務閒，出使褒貶。」疏奏，謐等遂不行。","content_fanyi":"朝廷因为河南、河北发生旱灾而下诏，派遣御史中丞崔谧等人分路前往慰问百姓、赈济灾民。侍御史宁陵人刘思立上疏认为：‘如今麦子吐穗，春蚕已经成熟，农事正繁忙，皇帝的使者出巡安抚，百姓个个高兴得踮脚鼓掌，丢下自己的家业，盼望借此得到皇上的恩典，聚集起来迎接参拜，妨害荒废了不少农事。既然进行赈济，就须设置登记簿册；这本是朝廷想要安抚存恤百姓，反倒成了烦扰。希望暂且把赈济之事交给各州县办理，等到秋后农闲，再派出使者考核褒贬州县的工作。’奏疏递上后，崔谧等人就没有启程。","content_jianti_auto":"4诏以河南、北旱，遣御史中丞崔谧等分道存问赈给。侍御史宁陵刘思立上疏：以为：「今麦秀蚕老，农事方殷，敕使抚巡，人皆竦抃，忘其家业，冀此天恩，聚集参迎，妨废不少。既缘赈给，须立簿书，本欲安存，更成烦扰。望且委州县赈给，待秋务闲，出使褒贬。」疏奏，谧等遂不行。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"者，未尽然也，所遣得人，则民不劳矣。若其不可者，饥非一邑...","context_before":"赈饥遣使，民有迎候之劳，如","source_end_index":18,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4d69c2bf-7fc0-4d58-ac61-f90735518e6e","source_start_index":13,"source_text":"刘思立所言"}],"title":"六 遣使赈饥当亟察有司之廉能"}],"id":19911,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4bc-db0e-11ef-a52c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"吐，從暾入聲。將，卽亮翻。說，輸芮翻。降，戶江翻。復，扶又翻。帥，讀曰率。","note_content_jianti_auto":"吐，从暾入声。将，即亮翻。说，输芮翻。降，户江翻。复，扶又翻。帅，读曰率。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4cf-db0e-11ef-bebe-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4d1-db0e-11ef-9735-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"晉官品令，游擊將軍第四品。唐從五品下。","note_content_jianti_auto":"晋官品令，游击将军第四品。唐从五品下。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4d0-db0e-11ef-a0ba-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"鎭將","official_note":"鎭將是唐代地方军事官职，负责镇守边疆或重要据点，此处指扶州临河镇的军事指挥官杜孝昇被吐蕃擒获。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"擒鎭將杜孝昇","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"11e85da4-b6f0-432a-83dc-ecbd98637dcc"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"松州都督","official_note":"松州都督是唐代地方行政和军事长官，掌管松州地区事务，此处吐蕃试图通过杜孝昇劝降武居寂。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"松州都督武居寂","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"c000d7fb-f304-4f29-8f1b-1e9bb64afcf1"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"游擊將軍","official_note":"游擊將軍是唐代武散官，通常授予有功将领，此处表示杜孝昇因坚守被任命此职以表彰其忠诚。","official_rank":"从五品下","source_snippet":"詔以孝昇爲游擊將軍","start_index