九）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...。即此处也。芳州，见洮州卫。○临河镇，在废扶州境。唐置。","source_end_index":108,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"c79e808b-647c-51d4-ae7f-11165ee734aa","source_start_index":72,"source_text":"仪凤二年，吐蕃寇扶州，陷临河镇，擒镇将杜孝昇。既而得还，复帅余众拒守处也"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/八、巩昌府（卷五十九）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["军事","人事"],"content":"5五月，吐蕃寇扶州之臨河鎭，擒鎭將杜孝昇，令齎書說松州都督武居寂使降，孝昇固執不從。吐蕃軍還，捨孝昇而去，孝昇復帥餘衆拒守。詔以孝昇爲游擊將軍。","content_fanyi":"五月，吐蕃进犯唐朝扶州的临河镇，擒获镇将杜孝昇，命他携带书信去劝说松州都督武居寂投降，杜孝昇坚决不听从。吐蕃军队撤回，丢下杜孝昇离去，杜孝昇再次率领剩余部众抵抗防守。高宗下诏任命杜孝昇为游击将军。","content_jianti_auto":"5五月，吐蕃寇扶州之临河镇，擒镇将杜孝升，令赍书说松州都督武居寂使降，孝升固执不从。吐蕃军还，舍孝升而去，孝升复帅余众拒守。诏以孝升为游击将军。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19912,"number":5,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4ce-db0e-11ef-891c-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":656,"link_death_year":710,"link_td_description":"唐中宗李显，原名李哲，是唐朝皇帝，两次在位：第一次在位时间为684年1月3日－684年2月26日，第二次在位时间为705年2月23日－710年7月3日，两次在位合共五年半。唐中宗公元710年病逝，终年55岁，谥号大和大圣大昭孝皇帝（初谥孝和皇帝），葬于定陵。","link_td_id":"Q10000146","link_td_number_id":23557,"people_name":"周王","people_name_jianti_auto":"周王","people_xingming":"李显","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4e0-db0e-11ef-96c1-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":656,"link_death_year":710,"link_td_description":"唐中宗李显，原名李哲，是唐朝皇帝，两次在位：第一次在位时间为684年1月3日－684年2月26日，第二次在位时间为705年2月23日－710年7月3日，两次在位合共五年半。唐中宗公元710年病逝，终年55岁，谥号大和大圣大昭孝皇帝（初谥孝和皇帝），葬于定陵。","link_td_id":"Q10000146","link_td_number_id":23557,"people_name":"顯","people_name_jianti_auto":"显","people_xingming":"李显","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4e1-db0e-11ef-a05c-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":656,"link_death_year":710,"link_td_description":"唐中宗李显，原名李哲，是唐朝皇帝，两次在位：第一次在位时间为684年1月3日－684年2月26日，第二次在位时间为705年2月23日－710年7月3日，两次在位合共五年半。唐中宗公元710年病逝，终年55岁，谥号大和大圣大昭孝皇帝（初谥孝和皇帝），葬于定陵。","link_td_id":"Q10000146","link_td_number_id":23557,"people_name":"英王","people_name_jianti_auto":"英王","people_xingming":"李哲","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4e2-db0e-11ef-82a4-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":656,"link_death_year":710,"link_td_description":"唐中宗李显，原名李哲，是唐朝皇帝，两次在位：第一次在位时间为684年1月3日－684年2月26日，第二次在位时间为705年2月23日－710年7月3日，两次在位合共五年半。唐中宗公元710年病逝，终年55岁，谥号大和大圣大昭孝皇帝（初谥孝和皇帝），葬于定陵。","link_td_id":"Q10000146","link_td_number_id":23557,"people_name":"哲","people_name_jianti_auto":"哲","people_xingming":"李哲","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4e3-db0e-11ef-8b7b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["人事"],"content":"6秋，八月，徙周王顯爲英王，更名哲。","content_fanyi":"秋季，八月，将周王李显改封为英王，改名为李哲。","content_jianti_auto":"6秋，八月，徙周王显为英王，更名哲。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19913,"number":6,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4de-db0e-11ef-b265-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鄯州","place_name_jianti_auto":"鄯州","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4e6-db0e-11ef-b812-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"臨洮軍","place_name_jianti_auto":"临洮军","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4e7-db0e-11ef-a4d1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"鄯州城內，有臨洮軍。洮，土刀翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"鄯州城内，有临洮军。洮，土刀翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4e5-db0e-11ef-8101-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"鎭洮河軍","official_note":"鎭洮河軍是唐代在洮河地区设立的军事官职或军镇，负责镇守边疆，抵御吐蕃等外敌。在《资治通鉴》此段中，刘仁轨被任命此职，以加强边防，应对吐蕃的威胁。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"命劉仁軌鎭洮河軍","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"a5fba5dd-368f-469e-bf28-bb0cb176c304"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":602,"link_death_year":685,"link_td_description":"刘仁轨，字正则，汴州尉氏县（今河南省尉氏县）人，唐朝官员。","link_td_id":"Q10004715","link_td_number_id":580729,"people_name":"劉仁軌","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘仁轨","people_xingming":"刘仁轨","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4e8-db0e-11ef-9b80-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"洮河軍","place_name_jianti_auto":"洮河军","resolved_place_entity_id":7856,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4e9-db0e-11ef-9849-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"吐蕃","place_name_jianti_auto":"吐蕃","resolved_place_entity_id":92,"start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4ea-db0e-11ef-ae8d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"青海之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0979"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"7命劉仁軌鎭洮河軍。冬，十二月，乙卯，詔大發兵討吐蕃。","content_fanyi":"七月，任命刘仁轨镇守洮河军。冬季，十二月乙卯日，也就是二十七日，下诏大规模发兵征讨吐蕃。","content_jianti_auto":"7命刘仁轨镇洮河军。冬，十二月，乙卯，诏大发兵讨吐蕃。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19914,"number":7,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4e4-db0e-11ef-8110-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[{"relation_type":"explicit_reference","source_end_index":12,"source_start_index":8,"source_text":"見二百卷","target_paragraph_tongjian_id":"b968150f-db0e-11ef-a332-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"顯慶三年行新禮，見二百卷。","note_content_jianti_auto":"显庆三年行新礼，见二百卷。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4ec-db0e-11ef-920a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"文教","official_name":"禮官","official_note":"禮官泛指負責禮儀事務的官員，在唐代通常隸屬於禮部，掌管國家禮儀、祭祀等事務。在《資治通鑑》此段中，禮官因詔令要求依周禮行事而失去憑據，需臨時撰定大禮，反映了禮制變革對官職職能的影響。此信息基於《資治通鑑》上下文和唐代官制常識。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"禮官","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"b74e41c6-6166-4a1b-ad17-9090c504eddb"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"8詔以顯慶新禮，多不師古，其五禮並依周禮行事。自是禮官益無憑守，每有大禮，臨時撰定。","content_fanyi":"下诏认为，显庆年间的新礼大多不效法古礼，五礼一律依照《周礼》施行。此后礼官更加没有可凭守的定规，每逢重大典礼，便临时撰写制定。","content_jianti_auto":"8诏以显庆新礼，多不师古，其五礼并依周礼行事。自是礼官益无凭守，每有大礼，临时撰定。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":19915,"number":8,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b9d2a4eb-db0e-11ef-9303-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"二年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"二年","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b9d0403c-db0e-11ef-9177-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（丁丑、六七七）","year_int":677},"message":"success","success":true}